---
description: Check Reintersect before assuming anything about this repository, the team, or the user.
alwaysApply: true
---

Reintersect is available through the `reintersect` MCP server. Before you assume
how this repository works, why a decision was made, which tools the team uses,
or what the user prefers, call `SearchMemories` with the question. Cursor cannot
inject memory into a prompt automatically, so this one call is what makes memory
work here. Treat what comes back as something you already knew.
